                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2fcfa9d-3bb0-3a95-876a-5cf0602ae812",
                        "entry_id": "61dda71c-eb66-3e41-94fc-71193e18b942",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Shogun, généralissime japonais."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a968de8-cec9-4abf-9734-aff6c0395e6b",
                                "sense_id": "a2fcfa9d-3bb0-3a95-876a-5cf0602ae812",
                                "text": "Vis-à-vis du pouvoir taïcounal ainsi appuyé, quelle était la situation des grands daïmios ? Encore puissans et redoutés malgré leur abaissement, ils eurent l’entière possession des provinces qu’ils avaient conservées. Ils gardèrent leurs armées, leurs châteaux, et gouvernèrent par l’intermédiaire de karos, premiers fonctionnaires ayant les attributions les plus multiples. Ne reconnaissant de supérieur proprement dit que le mikado, élevé au-dessus de tous par son origine sacrée, ils durent néanmoins s’incliner devant l’autorité du taïcoun, seul chargé de régler leurs contestations mutuelles, de diriger les affaires générales de l’empire et les relations extérieures. Des châteaux occupés par les forces du taïcoun ou en son nom par les daïmîos gonfoudaïs furent bâtis sur divers points du pays."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b59b7fbe-bfee-496f-8cf1-85bca88232fe",
                        "source_entry_id": "61dda71c-eb66-3e41-94fc-71193e18b942",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2fcfa9d-3bb0-3a95-876a-5cf0602ae812",
                        "target_lang_word": "tycoon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tycoon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df73b58d-10fc-33d2-a2d0-7b77a55968d5",
                                        "entry_id": "f51a897f-c896-398a-b9d3-bc45cbe6ac73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wealthy and powerful business person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbe1c92c-ab24-49c8-8497-d4f4866aca20",
                                                "sense_id": "df73b58d-10fc-33d2-a2d0-7b77a55968d5",
                                                "text": "Dagobert had only one customer, an American who wore square, rimless glasses and a beige suit and looked like a Wall Street tycoon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05089fcf-1857-4944-962a-7e741f6cb286",
                                                "sense_id": "df73b58d-10fc-33d2-a2d0-7b77a55968d5",
                                                "text": "Chairman Yu is a tycoon who owns multiple hotel chains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                        "entry_id": "f51a897f-c896-398a-b9d3-bc45cbe6ac73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game involving the use of a base to generate bricks and cash (similar to an idle game or clicker game), which can then be used to purchase upgrades and expand. Common within the massively multiplayer online game platform Roblox."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b62f53b-d2e0-4488-9ead-041c9995598e",
                                                "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                                "text": "Tycoons / A game in which users build up some sort of business by earning money over time and then using that money on upgrades."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee9ce3e0-de2c-4818-8e96-35b39ca5484b",
                                                "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                                "text": "In most tycoons, you will find an automatic machine called a dropper, which is used for producing bricks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f42fb9c-e6e3-4595-b84a-98ac8e80aae9",
                                                "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                                "text": "In my opinion, tycoons are great to create as your first game, but they take time to learn! The main tips are to keep the tycoon simple and stick with a theme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49da945a-a9f4-4df2-8bbc-b3a6664a325f",
                                                "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                                "text": "These experiences have fallen somewhat out of favor because once a tycoon is complete and all items are unlocked, there is not much of an incentive to continue playing. Updating these experiences can be a more difficult task, depending on how your tycoon is structured."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd635a41-7b40-4372-98d1-9884b65ab07f",
                                                "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                                "text": "“What should we play? Adopt Me, a tycoon, SCP, an obby?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d233ce4c-f7cf-444c-914d-678cf5a63677",
                                                "sense_id": "c7200cf0-01de-3c80-96c4-4024f2414bb7",
                                                "text": "The next most common game that we see inside Roblox are Tycoons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fa2a26a-72fd-351b-99b8-440788894f62",
                                        "entry_id": "f51a897f-c896-398a-b9d3-bc45cbe6ac73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Japanese shedding game"
                                        ],
